type: software
title: "ANTAR — Assessment of Niche, Treeline & Analogue Refugia"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid process-statistical framework for finding climate-resilient places to restore forest in Armenia: water stress,
  hydraulic failure, species niches, treeline change and scenario-robust planting decisions.
